				deltaXForBaseGlyph = 0.0  "For instance, if the first code point to display is a diacritic, like when building a FormGlyph for it"
					ifFalse: [
						deltaXForDiacriticalMark := deltaXToCenter - deltaXForBaseGlyph * sx.
