	^ `Color veryVeryLightGray`! !
!DenotativeObjectLightTheme methodsFor: 'tool colors' stamp: 'HAW 12/23/2022 09:27:20'!
      finderSearchBarSearchBoxColor
	"Answer the FinderSearchBar results color."

